{"3014240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASZG Project", "steam_appid": 3014240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;After a long period of global pandemic, the new virus DK-19 assailed the population. Many deniers claim that genetic mutation was a side effect caused by vaccines developed in a short period of testing and research. However, political activists fight this claim by saying that the genetic mutations of the DK-19 virus are from infected people who, in a negationist position, contracted the virus in an asymptomatic way, stimulating mutations through adverse treatments.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Regardless of the cause of the mutations, the DK-19 virus caused great damage to the bodies of the infected, generating chaos that had long been predicted...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014240/extras/04993892ddbfcfb88081eeea4a5eec70.avif?t=1788027215\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASZG is a psychological horror experience, where you must survive against creatures generated by the harmful DK-19 virus. Explore and survive in a completely devastated apocalyptic environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>WARNING: </strong>This game contains flashing lights, visual effects, loud noises and lots of jumpscares. Not recommended for highly sensitive persons.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;After a long period of global pandemic, the new virus DK-19 assailed the population. Many deniers claim that genetic mutation was a side effect caused by vaccines developed in a short period of testing and research. However, political activists fight this claim by saying that the genetic mutations of 